chunk |%20Dear%20ImGui%20|%20The%20immediate%20mode%20library%20this%20draws%20through%20|%20[github.com/ocornut/imgui](https://github.com/ocornut/imgui)%20|%0A
chunk |%20markdown-it-py%20|%20The%20parser%20that%20turns%20the%20source%20into%20tokens,%20with%20its%20own%20[documentation](https://markdown-it-py.readthedocs.io/)%20|%20[github.com/executablebooks](https://github.com/executablebooks/markdown-it-py)%20|%0A
